; Direct live ARM64 -> linked Metal transaction dispatcher. This deliberately
; asks state_save without an opened model: the expected carrier result is the
; real indexed failure receipt, which proves the BLR crossed into the dispatcher
; and returned safely. The final 0 is compact FAIL status after the full indexed
; receipt is written.
;
; witnessed: 2026-07-28 -> indexed state=none receipt, status 0
;
; preludes: native/metal/dsv4-jit-metal-abi.fk

(dsv4-jit-metal-transaction
    "fkwu-metal-transaction"
    "state_save\tjit-address-door\n")
